1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,745
So… did we make it?

2
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:09,353
Take this. Read it.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,400
It's blank.

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:18,434
You used to send me voice notes—ideas, plans, all
those thoughts you couldn't switch off. What happened?

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,700
I don't know how to write the ending yet.

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,176
Then start at the beginning.
Start with college.
